usage: module-nav deps-graph [-h] [--depth DEPTH] [--format {mermaid,dot,text}] [--reverse] name

positional arguments:
  name                  Module name (e.g. workbench-wb)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --depth DEPTH         Traversal depth (default 1)
  --format {mermaid,dot,text}
                        Output format (default: mermaid)
  --reverse             Show dependents instead of dependencies
